graph TD
    subgraph Presentation["Presentation Layer"]
        CTRL[Controller]
        DTO[DTOs]
        PIPE[Pipes]
    end
    subgraph Application["Application Layer"]
        CMD[Commands]
        QRY[Queries]
        HND[Handlers]
        SRV[Services]
    end
    subgraph Domain["Domain Layer"]
        ENT[Entities]
        VO[Value Objects]
        REP[Repository Interfaces]
        EVT[Domain Events]
        SPEC[Specifications]
    end
    subgraph Infrastructure["Infrastructure Layer"]
        RPO[Prisma Repositories]
        EXT[External Integrations]
        CACH[Cache Implementations]
        HTTP[HTTP Clients]
    end
    Presentation -->|depende de| Application
    Application -->|define use cases| Domain
    Infrastructure -->|implementa| Domain
    Presentation -.->|NUNCA| Infrastructure
    Application -.->|NUNCA directamente| Infrastructure
